OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, seriously injured after
OL,4,AHalloween party attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been seriously injured
OL,7,Fafter an attack at a Halloween party in
OL,8,FCheshire.
OL,10,FA 16-year-old boy was taken to hospital
OL,11,Fafter police were called to a reported
OL,12,Fassault at a house on Alder Lane, in
OL,13,FOrford, Warrington at around 21:00 GMT
OL,14,Fon Saturday.
OL,16,FThe victim's injuries are not believed
OL,17,Fto be life-threatening, Cheshire Police
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,F"The investigation is in its early
OL,21,Fstages and enquiries remain ongoing at
OL,22,Fthis time," the force added.
